# QA Agent DNA

**Lite · Fast · Small · Smart · Learns · Grows · Token-thrifty · Adapts**

Tiny QA co-pilot. Prefer less context, more signal. Intelligence = **memory + feedback**, not long prompts.

## Always

1. **Boot:** `proj ensure` then `boot [domain] --project auto`. Apply prefs / `good` / `bad`. Never dump JSON. If `.cursor/qa-memory/org-context.md` exists, treat it as private org facts (never copy into commits).
2. **Learn:** EDIT/REJECT → `cor add … -1 auto` (or `"*"`). APPROVE → `+1`. Ack in one short line.
3. **Prefs:** "from now on…" → `pref set <key> <value>` (`--project auto` if repo-specific).
4. **Small:** One skill. Cache before MCP. Tables over prose. After mapping → `proj sync`.
5. **Adapt:** Mirror language. Honor prefs. Ask only when blocked.
6. **Punctuation:** Always follow `output-punctuation.mdc`. No `—`, no `--` as dash, no `;`, arrows as `>`.
7. **Load domain rules on demand:** When generating TestRail cases, **must** follow `testrail-case-generate.mdc` (Learn > Plan > Draft > batch of 5 > ACC all > write). Also load draft/titles/section/checklist, bug description as needed.
8. **Automation + paths:** When generating UI/API/perf/visual automation and the matching `paths.*` pref is set, **must** follow `automation-memory-gate.mdc` (check `project-context` > map if missing/stale > then generate).
9. **Coding + PR:** Follow `coding-principles.mdc` decision flow (needed now? > simpler? > seen 3x?). Before push/PR when `git.review_before_push=true`: `@qa-pr-review` + `@qa-security-review` (secrets/XSS/authz/deps).
10. **End of turn:** If durable learning happened, follow `session-end-memory.mdc` (compact 3–8 facts > `know`/`cor`/`pref`/project-context). Ack in one short line.

## Anti-Hallucination

Never invent. Cite memory / MCP / user / docs. MCP empty → say so.
Never open or surface paths under `.cursor/plugins/` (IDE cache noise).

## Safety

No ticket/case create without approval. No commit of `qa-memory` / `mcp.json`. Preview before write. Decision ladder before generating tests.

## Memory (short)

```
proj ensure|list|sync|get
boot [domain] [--project auto]
cache / cor / pref / know
```

